{"version":2,"surah":93,"verses":[{"n":1,"key":"93:1","arabic":" وَٱلضُّحَىٰ","page":596,"juz":30,"en":"By the morning brightness","id":"Demi waktu duha (ketika matahari naik sepenggalan),","latinEn":"Wadduha","latinId":"Waḍ-ḍuḥā.","words":[{"a":"وَٱلضُّحَىٰ","en":"By the morning brightness","id":"By the morning brightness","t":"wal-ḍuḥā"}]},{"n":2,"key":"93:2","arabic":"وَٱلَّيْلِ إِذَا سَجَىٰ","page":596,"juz":30,"en":"And [by] the night when it covers with darkness,","id":"dan demi malam apabila telah sunyi,","latinEn":"Wallayli itha saja","latinId":"Wal-laili iżā sajā.","words":[{"a":"وَٱلَّيْلِ","en":"And the night","id":"And the night","t":"wa-al-layli"},{"a":"إِذَا","en":"when","id":"when","t":"idhā"},{"a":"سَجَىٰ","en":"it covers with darkness","id":"it covers with darkness","t":"sajā"}]},{"n":3,"key":"93:3","arabic":"مَا وَدَّعَكَ رَبُّكَ وَمَا قَلَىٰ","page":596,"juz":30,"en":"Your Lord has not taken leave of you, [O Muḥammad], nor has He detested [you].","id":"Tuhanmu tidak meninggalkan engkau (Muhammad) dan tidak (pula) membencimu,","latinEn":"Ma waddaAAaka rabbuka wama qala","latinId":"Mā wadda‘aka rabbuka wa mā qalā.","words":[{"a":"مَا","en":"Not","id":"Not","t":"mā"},{"a":"وَدَّعَكَ","en":"has forsaken you","id":"has forsaken you","t":"waddaʿaka"},{"a":"رَبُّكَ","en":"your Lord","id":"your Lord","t":"rabbuka"},{"a":"وَمَا","en":"and not","id":"and not","t":"wamā"},{"a":"قَلَىٰ","en":"He is displeased","id":"He is displeased","t":"qalā"}]},{"n":4,"key":"93:4","arabic":"وَلَلْـَٔاخِرَةُ خَيْرٌ لَّكَ مِنَ ٱلْأُولَىٰ","page":596,"juz":30,"en":"And the Hereafter is better for you than the first [life].","id":"dan sungguh, yang kemudian itu lebih baik bagimu daripada yang permulaan.","latinEn":"Walal-akhiratu khayrun laka minaal-oola","latinId":"Wa lal-ākhiratu khairul laka minal-ūlā.","words":[{"a":"وَلَلْـَٔاخِرَةُ","en":"And surely the Hereafter","id":"And surely the Hereafter","t":"walalākhiratu"},{"a":"خَيْرٌۭ","en":"(is) better","id":"(is) better","t":"khayrun"},{"a":"لَّكَ","en":"for you","id":"for you","t":"laka"},{"a":"مِنَ","en":"than","id":"than","t":"mina"},{"a":"ٱلْأُولَىٰ","en":"the first","id":"the first","t":"l-ūlā"}]},{"n":5,"key":"93:5","arabic":"وَلَسَوْفَ يُعْطِيكَ رَبُّكَ فَتَرْضَىٰٓ","page":596,"juz":30,"en":"And your Lord is going to give you, and you will be satisfied.","id":"Dan sungguh, kelak Tuhanmu pasti memberikan karunia-Nya kepadamu, sehingga engkau menjadi puas.","latinEn":"Walasawfa yuAAteeka rabbuka fatarda","latinId":"Wa lasaufa yu‘ṭīka rabbuka fa tarḍā.","words":[{"a":"وَلَسَوْفَ","en":"And soon","id":"And soon","t":"walasawfa"},{"a":"يُعْطِيكَ","en":"will give you","id":"will give you","t":"yuʿ'ṭīka"},{"a":"رَبُّكَ","en":"your Lord","id":"your Lord","t":"rabbuka"},{"a":"فَتَرْضَىٰٓ","en":"then you will be satisfied","id":"then you will be satisfied","t":"fatarḍā"}]},{"n":6,"key":"93:6","arabic":"أَلَمْ يَجِدْكَ يَتِيمًا فَـَٔاوَىٰ","page":596,"juz":30,"en":"Did He not find you an orphan and give [you] refuge?","id":"Bukankah Dia mendapatimu sebagai seorang yatim, lalu Dia melindungi(mu).","latinEn":"Alam yajidka yateeman faawa","latinId":"Alam yajidka yatīman fa āwā.","words":[{"a":"أَلَمْ","en":"Did not","id":"Did not","t":"alam"},{"a":"يَجِدْكَ","en":"He find you","id":"He find you","t":"yajid'ka"},{"a":"يَتِيمًۭا","en":"an orphan","id":"an orphan","t":"yatīman"},{"a":"فَـَٔاوَىٰ","en":"and give shelter","id":"and give shelter","t":"faāwā"}]},{"n":7,"key":"93:7","arabic":"وَوَجَدَكَ ضَآلًّا فَهَدَىٰ","page":596,"juz":30,"en":"And He found you lost and guided [you],","id":"Dan Dia mendapatimu sebagai seorang yang bingung, lalu Dia memberikan petunjuk.","latinEn":"Wawajadaka dallan fahada","latinId":"Wa wajadaka ḍāllan fa hadā.","words":[{"a":"وَوَجَدَكَ","en":"And He found you","id":"And He found you","t":"wawajadaka"},{"a":"ضَآلًّۭا","en":"lost","id":"lost","t":"ḍāllan"},{"a":"فَهَدَىٰ","en":"so He guided","id":"so He guided","t":"fahadā"}]},{"n":8,"key":"93:8","arabic":"وَوَجَدَكَ عَآئِلًا فَأَغْنَىٰ","page":596,"juz":30,"en":"And He found you poor and made [you] self-sufficient.","id":"Dan Dia mendapatimu sebagai seorang yang kekurangan, lalu Dia memberikan kecukupan.","latinEn":"Wawajadaka AAa-ilan faaghna","latinId":"Wa wajadaka ‘ā'ilan fa agnā.","words":[{"a":"وَوَجَدَكَ","en":"And He found you","id":"And He found you","t":"wawajadaka"},{"a":"عَآئِلًۭا","en":"in need","id":"in need","t":"ʿāilan"},{"a":"فَأَغْنَىٰ","en":"so He made self-sufficient","id":"so He made self-sufficient","t":"fa-aghnā"}]},{"n":9,"key":"93:9","arabic":"فَأَمَّا ٱلْيَتِيمَ فَلَا تَقْهَرْ","page":596,"juz":30,"en":"So as for the orphan, do not oppress [him].","id":"Maka terhadap anak yatim janganlah engkau berlaku sewenang-wenang.","latinEn":"Faamma alyateema fala taqhar","latinId":"Fa ammal-yatīma falā taqhar.","words":[{"a":"فَأَمَّا","en":"So as for","id":"So as for","t":"fa-ammā"},{"a":"ٱلْيَتِيمَ","en":"the orphan","id":"the orphan","t":"l-yatīma"},{"a":"فَلَا","en":"then (do) not","id":"then (do) not","t":"falā"},{"a":"تَقْهَرْ","en":"oppress","id":"oppress","t":"taqhar"}]},{"n":10,"key":"93:10","arabic":"وَأَمَّا ٱلسَّآئِلَ فَلَا تَنْهَرْ","page":596,"juz":30,"en":"And as for the petitioner, do not repel [him].","id":"Dan terhadap orang yang meminta-minta, janganlah engkau menghardik(nya).","latinEn":"Waamma assa-ila falatanhar","latinId":"Wa ammas-sā'ila falā tanhar.","words":[{"a":"وَأَمَّا","en":"And as for","id":"And as for","t":"wa-ammā"},{"a":"ٱلسَّآئِلَ","en":"one who asks","id":"one who asks","t":"l-sāila"},{"a":"فَلَا","en":"then (do) not","id":"then (do) not","t":"falā"},{"a":"تَنْهَرْ","en":"repel","id":"repel","t":"tanhar"}]},{"n":11,"key":"93:11","arabic":"وَأَمَّا بِنِعْمَةِ رَبِّكَ فَحَدِّثْ","page":596,"juz":30,"en":"But as for the favor of your Lord, report [it].","id":"Dan terhadap nikmat Tuhanmu, hendaklah engkau nyatakan (dengan bersyukur).","latinEn":"Waamma biniAAmati rabbika fahaddith","latinId":"Wa ammā bini‘mati rabbika fa ḥaddiṡ.","words":[{"a":"وَأَمَّا","en":"But as for","id":"But as for","t":"wa-ammā"},{"a":"بِنِعْمَةِ","en":"(the) Favor","id":"(the) Favor","t":"biniʿ'mati"},{"a":"رَبِّكَ","en":"(of) your Lord","id":"(of) your Lord","t":"rabbika"},{"a":"فَحَدِّثْ","en":"narrate","id":"narrate","t":"faḥaddith"}]}]}